  "note": "Extracted by hand from the ordering matrix on the sheet's final page, the 2100 family template: model dash size dash body material, then twelve character positions in six pairs with the slash the price book prints. Side entry, ISO 5211 direct mount, 400 psi WOG, brass. The price book prints codes for this series, 3T-3300R-100-BR/AAS46000003A among them, which is where the slash is evidenced. The limit switch column is headed Limit Swtich, the sheet's own slip. The solenoid and limit switch UT spans are enforced from the ranges printed in their own labels against the UT size named in the chosen operation code, and the start positions are bound to the port, T codes to the T port and L codes to the L port.",
